f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\">\\((\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEvents}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEvents}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}independent\\text{-}events} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEvents}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\nA\\in\\mathcal F\\land B\\in\\mathcal F\\land\n\\mathbb P(A\\cap B)=\\mathbb P(A)\\mathbb P(B)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}independent\\text{-}events} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEvents}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\nA\\in\\mathcal F\\land B\\in\\mathcal F\\land\n\\mathbb P(A\\cap B)=\\mathbb P(A)\\mathbb P(B)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"targ